{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome. You\u2019ve been officially hired as a temporary packaging staff member at XX Fulfillment Center. Please read the following instructions carefully to ensure smooth operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All packing errors are your responsibility (deductions may apply).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Absences or tardiness will reduce your priority for future shifts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b All characters, companies, and events in this game are entirely fictional. Any resemblance to real people or entities is purely coincidental.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Pack Happiness&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: pack the customer\u2019s happiness into a box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tape up the goods, slap on a shipping label, and double-check for defects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2014and don\u2019t forget to apply that &quot;Handle with Care&quot; sticker. Nobody likes broken eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=596 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cFollow the Rules\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve mastered the job? Think again. The fulfillment center keeps evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster conveyor belts. More damaged goods. Drone delivery systems that never sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new regulations and keep up the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistakes? Still your fault.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=498 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cExplore\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through the fulfillment center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to coworkers, accept quests, collect items, and discover hidden areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you walk off the job? Or help that shady character in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a story that changes based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cMultiple Endings\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your future isn\u2019t set in stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coworker collapsed? Got a job offer elsewhere?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore them\u2014focus on your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape your future.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842660?t=1756905327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3842660?t=1756905327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/2e3c0c55e5db331bb3e3b8b769af488a55bc9a83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756905327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/2e3c0c55e5db331bb3e3b8b769af488a55bc9a83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756905327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome. You\u2019ve been officially hired as a temporary packaging staff member at XX Fulfillment Center. Please read the following instructions carefully to ensure smooth operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All packing errors are your responsibility (deductions may apply).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Absences or tardiness will reduce your priority for future shifts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b All characters, companies, and events in this game are entirely fictional. Any resemblance to real people or entities is purely coincidental.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Pack Happiness&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is simple: pack the customer\u2019s happiness into a box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tape up the goods, slap on a shipping label, and double-check for defects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2014and don\u2019t forget to apply that &quot;Handle with Care&quot; sticker. Nobody likes broken eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=596 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/9b8b9a6cb86e1a721a637a90f52366bf.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cFollow the Rules\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve mastered the job? Think again. The fulfillment center keeps evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster conveyor belts. More damaged goods. Drone delivery systems that never sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new regulations and keep up the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mistakes? Still your fault.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=498 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/7b1f3c2c3ea0a53865554d1c141de4f3.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cExplore\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through the fulfillment center!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to coworkers, accept quests, collect items, and discover hidden areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens if you walk off the job? Or help that shady character in the shadows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a story that changes based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.poster.avif?t=1756905327\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.webm?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/extras/94d3643e757c9b420f03f582f6451c4a.mp4?t=1756905327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cMultiple Endings\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your future isn\u2019t set in stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coworker collapsed? Got a job offer elsewhere?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore them\u2014focus on your task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape your future.</p>","developers":["TwinChariot"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842660/ec7ccf9f7e0ad8a912e7eeb76b3ba21c7befb7e6/header.jpg?t=1756905327","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257180464,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180464/movie480.mp4?t=1756869493","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257180464/movie_max.mp4?t=1756869493"},"name":"XX Fulfillment Center Official Trailer - EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass